  "overview": {
    "description": "Trionfo Beccaccino (also Marafone Beccaccino) is a 4-player partnership trick-taking game from Romagna, Italy. It combines Tressette scoring (3-2-A ranking) with a trump suit (Trionfa). The 4â™¦ holder chooses trump. The Maraffa/Cricca (A+2+3 of trumps) earns 3 bonus points. Game to 41.",
